Additionally, he litigated and settled numerous cases of nursing home neglect and abuse. He has vigorously fought nursing homes to not only get compensation for his clients but also change the way nursing homes residents get treated. When pursuing a claim for nursing home neglect and abuse, you need his extensive litigation and nursing experience to get the results that you want.

